SUMMARY:Community Drum Circle
DESCRIPTION:Join Music Director Lars Potteiger for a fun\, hands-on drum circle in the Rader Park Pavilion! All ages are welcome\, and drums will be provided; bring your energy and love for rhythm! \n August 9th at 3 PM in Rader Park \nCome drum with us and feel the beat of community!
